Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're free at last! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.80,0:00:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up is Kaido! Kick. His. Ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.10,0:00:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick. His. Ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be careful! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So about Kaido, got a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna team up with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Get bent. You saw what he did to\Nmy partner. I want revenge myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.18,0:00:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Be grateful I don't finish you\Noff right now like I should.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't trust anyone\Nalliances are a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:00:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.52,0:01:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.94,0:01:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to get our crew back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.50,0:01:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.20,0:01:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll handle things our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Blueno the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.04,0:01:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We will find infinity for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.24,0:02:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's sail for this blue\Nsea and let the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.80,0:02:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Take us far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.42,0:02:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.06,0:02:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can come back to this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.86,0:02:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can be present right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw away this drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes we share.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.14,0:02:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut it up. Do not be\Nso afraid to find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.60,0:02:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,To have a friend right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will always be here by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.26,0:02:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,To take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.02,0:02:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in the darkest of times I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.18,0:02:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking brave, it's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we are the ones who\Nare meant to move them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.98,0:02:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move to a rushing horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.70,0:02:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We will find insanity for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.60,0:02:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We will step ahead. We will win for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:03:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming on, we will\Nmove towards the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We will fight however we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.82,0:03:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to be the best, we will run.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,To the top, to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.44,0:03:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta be the ones that\Njust keep dreaming on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.98,0:03:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't give up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can never stop cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.14,0:03:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta give everything I got to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Become the greatest of all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.10,0:03:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move towards the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We will find infinity for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.10,0:03:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We will step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.44,0:03:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we will reach for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't keep moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.00,0:03:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The toll of 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:04:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I hold on to such a hopeful\Ndream when we've lost so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten years was as much\Nindignity as they could stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,When they'd suffered enough, they\Nraided Onigashima and all perished.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.34,0:04:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been ten years already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We grow older by the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.80,0:04:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If we wait another ten\Nyears, we'll be even weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And what do we do if the people\Nwe're waiting for don't come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.58,0:04:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just trust in Lady Toki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.84,0:04:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, all of you,\Nour comrades, will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And Lord Momonosuke will be with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How much longer can we oppose Orochi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're so hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.34,0:04:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Starvation will kill us before any battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.02,0:05:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido's army is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.30,0:05:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That was our only will!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.04,0:05:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.26,0:05:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have some life in us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.34,0:05:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let us take action!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.10,0:05:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I forbid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.54,0:05:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll march to your deaths?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.54,0:05:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless we all unite under the\NKozuki banner, we'll fail!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.80,0:05:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:05:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.22,0:06:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We beg of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,At least let us die a samurai's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.08,0:06:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all we ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.26,0:06:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,To pass with the Cotton in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.40,0:06:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stand in our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.18,0:06:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We had a word when we were little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.86,0:06:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We would test our mettle\Nwith how loud we could yell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.12,0:06:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When people value themselves too\Nhighly, they stop taking risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.00,0:06:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Unachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.12,0:06:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender your name and be as a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear your mind and take the leap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.18,0:06:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That was our battle cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.14,0:07:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your voice and be heard! Tsunachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.72,0:07:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsunachi! Tsunachi! Tsunachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.24,0:07:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.34,0:07:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.82,0:07:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Shulaji!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shulaji!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.26,0:07:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shulaji! Shulaji!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.12,0:07:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shulaji!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.46,0:07:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,At least let us die a samurai death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.34,0:07:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.20,0:08:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsunachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsunachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.34,0:08:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did we all have to\Nsuffer this pain for
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,20 long years we'll know\Nonce the job is done?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.64,0:09:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely there is a deeper\Nmeaning I have no reason
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.44,0:09:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,to doubt Lord Odin listen\Nwe've got a new goal
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.88,0:09:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight days from now is the\Nfire festival in the name of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.46,0:09:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Odin we'll raid Onigashima\NSeek out the pirate invaders!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.10,0:09:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Drag Orochi and Kaido out\Nof hiding and kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.96,0:09:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you still have the metal to fight\Nback, then rise up and follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.50,0:09:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Count us in, Chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time we wreck those guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut us back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.92,0:09:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's clear you haven't\Nchanged at all, Kin'emon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.88,0:10:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We may have been the\Nsame age back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But keep in mind, we're now 20\Nyears stronger than you, young 'un.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.06,0:10:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him, doggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.52,0:10:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You, Kara, make a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet, old-timers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.96,0:10:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not slow us down. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.98,0:10:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet, you young pup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.38,0:10:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, calm down, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.50,0:10:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,None of us are equipped to\Nbreak up an Akazaya quarrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.20,0:10:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So the Straw Hat guy is\Na pirate, same as Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.16,0:10:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the same at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.94,0:10:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can't trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.30,0:10:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll just stab us right in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.04,0:10:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you bring one of\Nhis kind to help anyway, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.32,0:10:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The seas are vast, and not all\Npirates have ill intent, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.90,0:10:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That gentleman's involvement is crucial\Nin our plans to overthrow Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.02,0:11:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you expect us to trust him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.16,0:11:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got some convincing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.78,0:11:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I need something more to persuade them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.96,0:11:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, it seems they\Ncome to their senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true that you traveled\Nhere from 20 years in the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.82,0:11:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us! Race,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.52,0:11:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,you always looked a lot\Nolder than you really were,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.12,0:11:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's hard to tell if\Nyou've actually aged or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.42,0:11:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you didn't intend to be\Nhurtful, but come now! Did Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawhead just wander off?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.34,0:11:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tom, it's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.48,0:11:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.34,0:11:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Big Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.72,0:11:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.88,0:11:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm really happy\Nthat you're still okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.70,0:11:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's barely alive. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.66,0:11:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.92,0:11:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.96,0:11:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.58,0:11:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to find an antibody right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.22,0:11:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you show up when you\Nknew this would fall on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.06,0:11:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I would say that you deserved it, but I\Ncan see that you're clearly suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.58,0:11:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Zero, apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.40,0:12:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me. One sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.40,0:12:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy is extraordinary,\Neven if he is foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.34,0:12:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never do such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.12,0:12:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.68,0:12:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.38,0:12:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a Secret cat, and\Nweak as hell, and a wimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.64,0:12:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a big baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.36,0:12:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence, insolent dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.12,0:12:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no right to address\Nme in such a fashion!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.30,0:12:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, please don't punch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.26,0:12:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you chickening out on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.64,0:12:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.02,0:12:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.40,0:12:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Odin's son!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.08,0:12:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I possess every right to\Nbe Shogun of this land!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.32,0:13:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something about it, prove it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.06,0:13:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.16,0:13:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that! You're crazy! You'll kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.84,0:13:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I have to spill it out, dummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.52,0:13:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They're waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.40,0:13:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.06,0:13:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YES!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.12,0:13:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.44,0:13:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.52,0:13:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.18,0:13:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Aah! Ahh! Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.40,0:14:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.98,0:14:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.90,0:14:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.80,0:14:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.48,0:14:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the promise That we were lacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.08,0:14:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.88,0:14:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A driving force that\Nlies Beyond the battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.66,0:15:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've accomplished nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.08,0:15:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What they see is not myself,\Nbut the memory of my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.46,0:15:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The great shadow cast by him that\Nprotected the land of Wano long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.00,0:15:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.91,0:15:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.14,0:15:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.14,0:15:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to vanquish Everikido!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.50,0:16:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, you mustn't\Nbe afraid. Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.38,0:16:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please hear me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.42,0:16:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall speak to you of the\Njourney I have undertook.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.18,0:16:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,After arriving in the present,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.14,0:16:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent out with Kin'emon and\Nthe others in search of allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.72,0:16:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,However, we were struck\Nwith tragedy and separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.98,0:16:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I found myself in a dangerous\Nplace with no hope of escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.78,0:16:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I faced many trials, and if not for\Nthe aid of Luffy and his comrades,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I surely would not be\Nstanding here before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.68,0:16:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I may be weak and lack experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.52,0:16:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but I will avenge my family and the\Nland of Wano, no matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.58,0:16:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in my darkest hour, I was\Nable to carry on because I held on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.66,0:17:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,to one dear thing a dream my goal\Nis clear i must find like-minded
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,allies my countrymen you are the\Npeople who support i need more than
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.32,0:17:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,ever the people of this land every\None of us shares the same desire
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.22,0:17:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Take back our home!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.46,0:17:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you've suffered greatly,\Nwaiting for all these years!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.44,0:17:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So I thank you with all of\Nmy heart for your faith!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.06,0:17:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I am heir to Lord Odin,\Ndaimyo of this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.12,0:17:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Kozuki Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.96,0:17:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.38,0:17:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us rise up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.86,0:18:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It warms my heart to see Lord Momonosuke\Ntaking charge so boldly. Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.00,0:18:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I must take leave for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.72,0:18:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have my word I shall rejoin you\Nbefore the battle. Very well. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.38,0:18:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.29,0:18:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,my
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.21,0:18:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.58,0:18:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we finally done with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got too many damn ninjas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.50,0:19:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Pain in my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.18,0:19:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro-Judo, are you injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.30,0:19:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.74,0:19:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I've become a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.16,0:19:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.60,0:19:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.88,0:19:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you got killed, I'd never be\Nable to show my face to Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.68,0:19:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So where do we head next?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.20,0:19:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That house in the snow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.72,0:19:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need a good hiding place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.66,0:19:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The location doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.88,0:19:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to track down that\Nguy who stole my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.42,0:19:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can guide you to him easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He's always at Bandit's Bridge in Ringo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get it back before the big raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.74,0:19:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel comfortable without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.00,0:20:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have really pissed off Oduchi, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.72,0:20:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He's pulling out all the\Nstops to hunt us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.72,0:20:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Otaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.54,0:20:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope she's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.54,0:20:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasui!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.24,0:20:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.12,0:20:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,After having to witness\Nsuch a horrible scene,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.18,0:20:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I'd been able to stay by her side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.08,0:20:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can work that out when you see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.14,0:20:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends will keep her safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.66,0:20:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.98,0:20:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Orji will pay for what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.64,0:20:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll avenge Tonoyasu at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.52,0:21:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I was strong, if I had the\Npower, I would kill him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.74,0:21:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.86,0:21:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you let those\Nloathsome traitors escape?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.44,0:21:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And what of that savage\NRonin who attacked me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.84,0:21:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.75,0:21:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed you, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.38,0:21:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any more bad news, Will?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.48,0:21:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, good news!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.08,0:21:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We captured a man named Trafalgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.30,0:21:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Say again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.70,0:21:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.76,0:22:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who in the hell is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.12,0:22:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an enemy intruder,\Njust like Straw had. Now we
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,have two of their masterminds\Nunder our control.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.30,0:22:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They're helpless. What\Nare you doing with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.30,0:22:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,For pirates betrayal never\Ngoes out of style right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.24,0:22:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're putting that to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.30,0:22:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll torture him first, but we'll\Nfind other uses for him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.50,0:22:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That is good news and what of the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.50,0:22:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,capital have you quelled the riots yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.78,0:22:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all under control. Local\Nforces are on high alert. Samurai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.14,0:22:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and ninja are on patrol as we\Nspeak combing every street and
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.80,0:22:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,establishment in town it's only a\Nmatter of time until the intruders
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.04,0:22:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,are caught while we're settling\Nthat I promise we'll keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.66,0:23:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you see any of these criminals,\Nyou must report it immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.12,0:23:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, there's so many!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.72,0:23:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of bad guys on the loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.04,0:23:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's treason to aid them in any way, and\Nallowing them to escape is a crime as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.90,0:23:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So take heed!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.22,0:23:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.86,0:23:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we're clearing out\Nof the capital for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.48,0:23:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not just wanted here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.26,0:23:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's the entire country!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.72,0:23:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi's network of assassins will be on\Nthe lookout for us, ready for a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, our objective was to\Nfind allies with the Moon Tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.48,0:23:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like kind of an\Nempty victory, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.08,0:23:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.99,0:23:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless we can free them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.66,0:23:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not criminals! Let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.22,0:23:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down and shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.46,0:23:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Toniyasu's speech\Nwould have done the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.86,0:24:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So now they're just keeping them\Nlocked up for the hell of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.22,0:24:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it might be\Nsomething like that, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a thousand or so\Nrebels in the prisoners' quarters,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.18,0:24:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,suffering the whims of Orochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.26,0:24:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, shouldn't they have\Nset these guys free by now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.82,0:24:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How would that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.18,0:24:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Orochi says, I goofed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.06,0:24:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't expect the Shogun\Nto admit he was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.26,0:24:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.08,0:24:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,These people have proven\Nthemselves to be our allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.36,0:24:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We need them, and beyond\Nthat, we owe them our aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.80,0:24:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Law's buddies must be\Nstuck in there too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.96,0:24:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shinobu, what are those people doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.10,0:24:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're preparing skyboats.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.70,0:24:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they for?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.52,0:24:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyboats are an important\Npart of the fire festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.06,0:24:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Two beloved figures just died.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.36,0:24:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They must not feel like celebrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.40,0:24:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's just the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.86,0:25:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Fire Festival is an event to honor\Nfriends and family who have passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.72,0:25:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And the bigger the celebration, the more\Nlikely your thoughts will reach the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.94,0:25:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.85,0:25:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like they'd better\Nparty pretty hard then.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.60,0:25:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You made it that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.86,0:25:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.32,0:25:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to worry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.46,0:25:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a real mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.90,0:25:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't catch the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.22,0:25:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But I heard you got caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.56,0:25:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily we escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.02,0:25:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.46,0:25:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.66,0:25:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.00,0:25:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.32,0:25:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasuie. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.34,0:25:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He gave you this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.56,0:26:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He drew that symbol and showed\Nit to the people with the tattoos
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.94,0:26:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,before he died. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.68,0:26:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something different.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.02,0:26:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like he added\Ntwo lines to the snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.90,0:26:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.54,0:26:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He changed the meaning,\Nbut I don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.96,0:26:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Seemed to work out, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.26,0:26:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What I mean is the people\Nfrom Wano understood it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.34,0:26:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Yosui's final message to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.24,0:26:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is kind of a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.42,0:26:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show Kin'emon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.42,0:26:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.68,0:26:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.02,0:26:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Better get going, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.12,0:26:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you need help, come to\NAmigasa Village, kay? Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.40,0:26:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,When you see your friends,\Ntell them we said hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.60,0:26:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.70,0:26:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.61,0:26:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.60,0:27:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We made a bargain and\Nyour lives were the chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.98,0:27:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lives? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.72,0:27:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This sounds like a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.80,0:27:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite straightforward.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.98,0:27:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If I refuse to release you, Then\Nyour captain will take my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.40,0:27:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is to say, he'll take yours as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.32,0:27:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Never betting on tomorrow, he'll make\Nany sacrifice without a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.40,0:27:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that I must take\Nhis threat very seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.34,0:27:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.94,0:27:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We blew it, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.34,0:27:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,These are your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.82,0:27:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm returning them to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.78,0:27:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I hold no power over them,\Nand they're free to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.98,0:27:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust this meets your\Nconditions, Trafalgar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.80,0:27:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lives aren't worth it! Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.06,0:27:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.96,0:27:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet and listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.80,0:28:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell the Straw Hats I was caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.20,0:28:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone asks questions,\Njust say you escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.34,0:28:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it! Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.34,0:28:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.32,0:28:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.46,0:28:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not worth it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.22,0:28:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.78,0:28:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.08,0:28:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, who knows what our captain\Nis going through with their clutches!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.98,0:28:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't just sit around and wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.76,0:28:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,As the Heart Pirates, we have a job to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.54,0:28:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll save our captain\Nno matter what it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.70,0:28:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kittymon's plan will have to wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.74,0:28:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not let our captain die!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.72,0:29:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have had enough of you, Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.58,0:29:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.64,0:29:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you need to\Nstep away for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.72,0:29:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been acting out of sorts ever\Nsince we began this interrogation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.20,0:29:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.11,0:29:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't overthink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.62,0:29:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.88,0:29:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, it shouldn't\Ntake long after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.26,0:29:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need this\Nunpleasantness to drag on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.34,0:30:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We know you're connected to\NStraw Hat, so start talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.80,0:30:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why have you come to the land of Wano?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.52,0:30:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you plotting?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.12,0:30:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I want every last detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.98,0:30:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
